<title>JAPAN: Japan traders expect Russian platinum on Saturday.</title>
<headline>Japan traders expect Russian platinum on Saturday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's first shipments of platinum in six months are expected to arrive in Japan on Saturday, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said on Thursday they had received an invoice from Russia's Almazjuvelierexport, the state metals export agency, which showed the metal would arrive in Tokyo by Monday.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk, +81-3-3432-6179</p>
